{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakened at the bottom of god's frozen temple, use magical spells, weapons, and charms to fight your way to the top in order to prevent humanity from  ascending into godhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deiity Under Ice is a first person combat game where working smart beats working hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.poster.avif?t=1773949972\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.webm?t=1773949972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.mp4?t=1773949972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons and find secrets as you ascend through the 8 floors of the temple (and many secret levels!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with a sandbox of weapons, spells, and passive charms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual wield weapons and spells that compliment each-other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to permanently upgrade your gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.poster.avif?t=1773949972\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.webm?t=1773949972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.mp4?t=1773949972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to kill enemies, kill enemies to gain mana</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange tokens for weapons, or save them to become stronger later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance use of weapons and spells to get the most bang out of your buck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.poster.avif?t=1773949972\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.webm?t=1773949972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.mp4?t=1773949972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle many unique enemies, no two feel the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover their strengths and weaknesses, and leverage them for your benefit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you decide to play, thank you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738090?t=1773949972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/9359b6868442e1ed947e0f13852aea635919bf0f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773949972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/8a268d88a74e300224bd32838a2f5740b234c504/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773949972","capsule_imagev5":"https://sh